    "notes": "The land of Sunny Isles, MSM's own recipe rather than a copy of a vanilla file: middle-sized islands in about half sea. The noise router's final_density (msm_starter:sunny_isles/final_density) shapes the land, its continents and temperature pick the biomes, and spawn_target starts players on an island. The surface rule (material_rule) puts bedrock at the bottom, then grass over dirt on land, sand over sandstone in deserts and on beaches, sand under water, and stone everywhere else."
